---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Nav from "../components/landing/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/landing/Footer.astro";

const h2 = "mt-14 text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-neutral-950";
const p = "mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-neutral-700";
---

<Base
  title="Terms — Kampa"
  description="Kampa is free, open-source, browser-only software provided as-is. Here is what that means for you."
>
  <Nav />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pt-16 pb-24">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-neutral-950">
      Terms
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-neutral-500">Effective 25 July 2026.</p>

    <h2 class={h2}>What Kampa is</h2>
    <p class={p}>
      Kampa is free, open-source software that runs entirely in your browser. It
      is provided as-is. There is no subscription, no account, and no support
      contract behind it.
    </p>

    <h2 class={h2}>Your responsibilities</h2>
    <p class={p}>
      Your Anthropic account is yours, your API key is yours, and the costs it
      runs up are yours. Kampa cannot see or control your spending.
    </p>
    <p class={p}>
      Review what the AI writes before you publish it. Marketing claims, prices,
      discounts, and legal compliance in your country are your call, not the
      model's. Treat every generated campaign as a first draft from a fast
      intern.
    </p>

    <h2 class={h2}>No warranty</h2>
    <p class={p}>
      Kampa comes with no warranty of any kind. We do not guarantee that it is
      fit for your purpose, that its output is accurate, or that the site stays
      available.
    </p>

    <h2 class={h2}>Liability</h2>
    <p class={p}>
      To the extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any damages arising
      from your use of Kampa, including lost revenue, lost data, or API costs.
    </p>

    <h2 class={h2}>Changes</h2>
    <p class={p}>
      These terms may change. The effective date at the top tells you when they
      last did. Continued use of Kampa means you accept the current version.
    </p>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
